      "message": "feat(post): Mach3 Mill post for 3-axis mills\n\nAdd mach3.cps. T<n> M6 then G43 H<n>, canned cycles G73/G81/G82/G83/\nG85/G86/G89 with G98, the dwell unit as a post option (seconds or\nmilliseconds, as Mach3's \"G04 Dwell param in ms\" setting), G91.1 in the\nheader. G41/G42, G84 tapping, probing and a G83 dwell are refused by\nname.\n\nFixes #2482\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
